ndemnification and non-grossable D&O bar, the tier-indexed structural teeth, and that the fairness criterion is a published political choice, not a technical fact. The residue is two clean empirical cruxes — both stated by the Skeptic as the things that would move him. One: draft the conduct exclusion so it provably lands on the person and survives the gross-up. Two: show per-case causal isolation across the feature space, with latent-proxy detection validated against Obermeyer as the path. I'll take both tests. The cost of refusing to run them isn't abstract: the disparity in that 2019 case is already measurable, sitting in the data right now, and declining to attribute it is a choice about which woman stays invisible. That's the bill that comes due whether or not anyone writes the statute.",
