    {"symbol": "🔌", "tooltip": "Hardware-level telemetry sits below the firm's routing layer like a meter on the mains, reading raw traffic the firm can't reroute around."},
    {"symbol": "⚖️", "tooltip": "The program keeps the discovery courtroom for uncorrected harms and adds real-time population-wide detection the courtroom never had."}
  ],
