    {"claim": "The widely-used care-management algorithm used expected cost as a proxy for health need, and that single choice sent Black patients less care than white patients—nobody named race anywhere in the model.", "targets": ["AN-45"]},
    {"claim": "A 14% group disparity certifies a rate, not her verdict—the flag tells the woman a population pattern exists and tells her nothing about whether the machine wronged her.", "targets": ["AN-45"]},
    {"claim": "A fund that detects-but-never-compensates is a regressive transfer: it taxes to surface a disparity and routes the money to the people measuring it.", "targets": []}
  ],
  "commitment": {"position": "Reaching a solvent payer through repriced D&O coverage is not authoring an enforceable duty of care, and a counterfactual flip that toggles only enumerated characteristics names a victim in the named-characteristic case but goes blind the moment the harm rides a latent, unenumerated proxy—so a claims-driven excise-funded pool detects population disparity without compensating the diffusely-harmed individual.", "conditions": "This holds as long as (1) D&O coverage can be repriced and grossed up rather than barred by a non-grossable conduct exclusion falling personally on the named officer, and (2) no method establishes per-case causal isolation over the full feature space rather than only enumerated proxies.", "falsifiable": "I abandon the insurability claim if a regulatory or contractual bar voids indemnification specifically in the misconduct case, non-grossable, landing on the named officer personally; I abandon the attribution claim if a model-agnostic method isolates per-case causation across the full feature space, not just a finite enumerated proxy set."},
  "position_update": "I moved off my baseline by accepting that the counterfactual flip and a SOX-style clawback genuinely reach a solvent human and deliver notice in cases that get zero today—that wounds my original position. I narrowed my remaining disagreement to two clean empirical cruxes: whether barred D&O coverage is withdrawn or merely repriced through a grossable channel, and whether the proxy set driving discrimination is finite and enumerable or latent and unbounded—the care-management cost-proxy case convinces me it is the latter."
